  "globalSearch-instructions-description": "Rechèch yo ka gen operatè pou presize rechèch la. Ou defini yon operatè lè ou ekri non operatè a ak valè a, separe ak de pwen. Pa egzanp, `list:Blocked` ta limite rechèch la ak kat ki nan yon lis ki rele *Blocked*. Si valè a gen espas oswa karaktè espesyal, mete li ant gimè (pa egzanp `__operator_list__:\"To Review\"`).",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operators": "Operatè ki disponib:",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-board": "`__operator_board__:<title>` - kat nan tablo ki koresponn ak *<title>* presize a",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-list": "`__operator_list__:<title>` - kat nan lis ki koresponn ak *<title>* presize a",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-swimlane": "`__operator_swimlane__:<title>` - kat nan kouloir ki koresponn ak *<title>* presize a",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-comment": "`__operator_comment__:<text>` - kat ki gen yon kòmantè ki gen *<text>*.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-label": "`__operator_label__:<color>` `__operator_label__:<name>` - kat ki gen yon etikèt ki koresponn ak *<color>* oswa *<name>",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-hash": "`__operator_label_abbrev__<name|color>` - fòm kout pou `__operator_label__:<color>` oswa `__operator_label__:<name>`",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-user": "`__operator_user__:<username>` - kat kote *<username>* se yon *manm* oswa *moun ki asiyen*",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-at": "`__operator_user_abbrev__username` - fòm kout pou `user:<username>`",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-member": "`__operator_member__:<username>` - kat kote *<username>* se yon *manm*",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-assignee": "`__operator_assignee__:<username>` - kat kote *<username>* se yon *moun ki asiyen*",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-creator": "`__operator_creator__:<username>` - kat kote *<username>* se kreyatè kat la",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-org": "`__operator_org__:<display name|short name>` - kat ki pou yon tablo asiyen ak òganizasyon *<name>*",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-team": "`__operator_team__:<display name|short name>` - kat ki pou yon tablo asiyen ak ekip *<name>*",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-due": "`__operator_due__:<n>` - kat ki rive nan limit jiska *<n>* jou apati kounye a. `__operator_due__:__predicate_overdue__ afiche tout kat ki depase dat limit yo.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-created": "`__operator_created__:<n>` - kat ki te kreye sa gen *<n>* jou oswa mwens",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-modified": "`__operator_modified__:<n>` - kat ki te modifye sa gen *<n>* jou oswa mwens",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-status": "`__operator_status__:<status>` - kote *<status>* se youn nan sa yo:",
  "globalSearch-instructions-status-archived": "`__predicate_archived__` - kat ki achive",
  "globalSearch-instructions-status-all": "`__predicate_all__` - tout kat ki achive ak sa ki pa achive",
  "globalSearch-instructions-status-ended": "`__predicate_ended__` - kat ki gen yon dat fen",
  "globalSearch-instructions-status-public": "`__predicate_public__` - kat nan tablo piblik sèlman",
  "globalSearch-instructions-status-private": "`__predicate_private__` - kat nan tablo prive sèlman",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-has": "`__operator_has__:<field>` - kote *<field>* se youn nan `__predicate_attachment__`, `__predicate_checklist__`, `__predicate_description__`, `__predicate_start__`, `__predicate_due__`, `__predicate_end__`, `__predicate_assignee__` oswa `__predicate_member__`. Mete yon `-` devan *<field>* pou chèche absans yon valè nan chan sa a (pa egzanp `has:-due` chèche kat ki pa gen dat limit).",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-sort": "`__operator_sort__:<sort-name>` - kote *<sort-name>* se youn nan `__predicate_due__`, `__predicate_created__` oswa `__predicate_modified__`. Pou yon triyaj desandan, mete yon `-` devan non triyaj la.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-limit": "`__operator_limit__:<n>` - kote *<n>* se yon nonb antye pozitif ki eksprime kantite kat pou afiche pa paj.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-notes-1": "Ou ka presize plizyè operatè.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-notes-2": "Operatè ki sanble yo konbine avèk *OR*. Kat ki koresponn ak nenpòt kondisyon ap retounen.\n`__operator_list__:Available __operator_list__:Blocked` ta retounen kat ki nan nenpòt lis ki rele *Blocked* oswa *Available*.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-notes-3": "Operatè ki diferan yo konbine avèk *AND*. Se sèlman kat ki koresponn ak tout operatè diferan yo ki retounen. `__operator_list__:Available __operator_label__:red` retounen sèlman kat nan lis *Available* ki gen yon etikèt *red*.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-notes-3-2": "Ou ka presize jou kòm yon nonb antye pozitif oswa negatif, oswa itilize `__predicate_week__`, `__predicate_month__`, `__predicate_quarter__` oswa `__predicate_year__` pou peryòd aktyèl la.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-notes-4": "Rechèch tèks yo pa fè diferans ant lèt majiskil ak miniskil.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-notes-5": "Pa defo, rechèch la pa chèche kat ki achive.",
